<title>USA: TABLE-Dravo Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Dravo Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>DRAVO CORPORATION AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>			Consolidated Statements of Earnings</p>
<p>		    (unaudited,  in 000's, except per share$data)</p>
<p>						   For the three months</p>
<p>						     ended June 30,</p>
<p>						 1997		    1996</p>
<p> Revenue				   42,435		  39,349</p>
<p> Net earnings			     4,312		   3,448</p>
<p> Earnings per share			0.25		    0.19</p>
<p> Shares outstanding		    14,818		  14,894</p>
<p>						    For the six months</p>
<p>							ended June 30,</p>
<p>						 1997		    1996</p>
<p> Revenue				   80,059		  77,573</p>
<p> Net earnings			     5,386		   6,557</p>
<p> Earnings per share			0.28		    0.36</p>
<p> Shares outstanding		    14,851		  14,859</p>
